              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, javelins and buckler. They may replace javelins and buckler with composite bow (+1) or sling (free). All are Skirmishers. One unit of skirmishers may be upgraded to WS3, BS4, LD7 armed with bow (+8) as Cretans but this must be the smallest skirmishing unit in the army. Note that the Allies and Mercenaries rule does not apply to these troops.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="cdcb-6234-c16b-46b8" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
